<h1>press kit</h1>
<p class="muted">One-pager for anyone writing about or linking to trendscope. Markdown twin: <a href="docs/press-kit.md">docs/press-kit.md</a>.</p>

<h2>taglines</h2>
<blockquote>the developer attention dataset — updated daily</blockquote>
<blockquote>What developers read, build and download — snapshotted daily from 9,200+ public feeds and APIs, plus 19 years of Hacker News history. Open data (CC0). Live: trendscope.zalize.com</blockquote>

<h2>hard numbers (Nov 2026)</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Metric</th><th>Value</th><th>Source</th></tr>
<tr><td>Sources tracked</td><td>9,200+</td><td><a href="data/feeds.json">feeds.json</a> · <a href="state-of-rss.html">census</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>Daily items</td><td>~109,000</td><td><a href="data/latest.json">latest.json</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>Free tools</td><td>90+</td><td><a href="tools/all.html">tools/all</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>API endpoints</td><td>28+ JSON/CSV/RSS/OPML</td><td><a href="api.html">api.html</a> · <a href="swagger.html">swagger</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>OPML bundles</td><td>14 lanes + full registry</td><td><a href="feeds.html">feeds.html</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>Embed modes</td><td>25 iframe cards + web component</td><td><a href="embeds.html">embeds.html</a></td></tr>
